_refine.details                                  
;The 3 amino acids at the N terminus (FNK) of chain 
G have been removed for the refinement as they did 
not fit in any electronic density. However, the same
amino acids have been kept in chain H for refinement
as more electron density is observed. The side chain
atoms of Lys 805 from chain H are not defined by
electronic density, then we decided to remove these
atoms.
;
